dialog_lines = Array[String](["VOLT|A human! Perfect. Our robots flew too close to the sun. Literally.", "YOU|Sun-scrambled?", "VOLT|They sort bolts by horoscope now. One insists bubble sort is 'a lifestyle'. They need recalibration by someone who remembers computer science.", "YOU|And you can't do it because...?", "VOLT|We never learned it! The robots always did the robot stuff. Pass the recalibration exam, re-teach them, and the asteroid blaster in our armory is yours.", "YOU|Why would I need an asteroid blaster?", "VOLT|Have you SEEN the belt around Ataraxia? Exactly. Exam starts NOW."])
